  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "refactor(memory): revamp Buffer for span-first execution and strict ownership\n\n      - Architecture: Shifted to a Span-first approach, eliminating `Memory.Span` conversion overhead in hot-paths.\n      - State Management: Replaced `_data` backing field with an auto-property `Data` initialized to `Array.Empty<byte>()`.\n      - Micro-optimizations: Removed redundant `Data != null` checks (impossible state) and stripped manual boundary validations in 2-parameter Span slices to leverage JIT intrinsics.\n      - Memory Safety: Removed external `Attach(byte[])` overloads to enforce strict ArrayPool ownership and prevent external reference-sharing corruption.\n      - API Ergonomics: Refactored `this[Range]` and `this[Index]` indexers to delegate directly to `AsSpan()`, ensuring correct logical boundaries with zero overhead.",
